  "description": "A comfortable and relaxing ride is what the LXI Flow 2 is all about. combining a Del Sol Comfort Springer saddle together with a suspension seat post, a suspension fork and an adjustable rise stem will guaranty this. And the lightweight aluminum frame, a Shimano Rapidfire Plus 1x8 drivetrain and mechanical disc brakes will offer the rider light and efficient performance. Lastly and no less important, a uniquely proper fitting bicycle for most rider heights is achieved through frame sizing and proportionate wheel size. Depending on the frame size that best fits the customer, the bicycle is equipped with either a 26\", 27.5\" or a 29\" wheel size.\nLXI Flow lightweight aluminum frame with Size-Specific Wheel design and disc brake mount\n60mm Travel suspension fork\nForged Alloy crank arms, steel 38t chainwheel with dual guard\nWide-range 1x8 drivetrain with Shimano Acera Rapidfire Plus shifter\nAlloy adjustable rise-angle stem with 80mm rise steel handlebar\nDel Sol Comfort Springer saddle with suspension seat post\nAlloy double wall rims with stainless steel spokes and Kenda Kwick Journey tires\nJAK Mechanical Disc",
